        "content": "<p>dhil opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14438\">PR #14438</a> from <code>dhil:stack-switching-spec-tests</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This patch imports the <code>cont.wast</code> kitchen sink test file and the <code>resume_throw.wast</code> (named <code>resume_throw_spec.wast</code> here) from the <a href=\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/stack-switching\">https://github.com/WebAssembly/stack-switching</a> repository.</p>\n<p>I am positive there is some test coverage overlap here. However, I am not sure there is much point in tidying the tests right now. I think this is something that should be done on the spec repository first.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
